<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/20th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Rawdat Muhanna</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1906</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Rawdat Muhanna was fought in April 1906 in the Qassim region of central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arabia">Arabia</a> between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-saud">Abd al-Aziz ibn Saud</a> and Abd <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/al-aziz">al-Aziz</a> ibn Mutib, emir of Jabal Shammar. The Rashidi emir was killed, and the Ottoman troops who had supported him soon withdrew from Qassim. The battle secured Ibn Saud's hold on southern and central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/najd">Najd</a>.</p></div>
